{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unkept is a short adventure game that is all about flow of movement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By sliding, swinging and diving you traverse and restore a corrupted kingdom.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area is unlocked by restoring the previous one, you do this by destroying parasites, planting seeds and chasing down corrupted gardeners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Movement</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player gains speed by making themselves heavier while sliding downhill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976550/extras/dc72c00b7730b6337e887d7ae6bb2a81.poster.avif?t=1756880068\" aria-label=\"The player gains speed by making themselves heavier while sliding downhill.\" width=616 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976550/extras/dc72c00b7730b6337e887d7ae6bb2a81.webm?t=1756880068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976550/extras/dc72c00b7730b6337e887d7ae6bb2a81.mp4?t=1756880068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doing this in the air will make you land faster and give you a speed boost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976550/extras/a02a0dd7262877d3016ebaa6aa273ebd.poster.avif?t=1756880068\" aria-label=\"Doing this in the air will make you land faster and give you a speed boost (it will also replenish your watering tank)\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976550/extras/a02a0dd7262877d3016ebaa6aa273ebd.webm?t=1756880068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976550/extras/a02a0dd7262877d3016ebaa6aa273ebd.mp4?t=1756880068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying various corruptions increases your restoration counter and gives you access to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976550/extras/7ff824721f121fea844dd59c45b98c79.poster.avif?t=1756880068\" aria-label=\"Destroying various corruptions increases your restoration counter and gives you access to new areas.\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976550/extras/7ff824721f121fea844dd59c45b98c79.webm?t=1756880068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976550/extras/7ff824721f121fea844dd59c45b98c79.mp4?t=1756880068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976550?t=1756880068","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976550?t=1756880068","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976550/1c6649269304dff50f19c192e5b5dafc06a262a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756880068","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976550/1c6649269304dff50f19c192e5b5dafc06a262a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756880068","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support"